I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the request asks for an HTTP capability the graph doesn't yet grant. It would also send untrusted item text into an outbound URL. The approval isn't reflected in the graph definition, so I can't verify it. Once the graph is updated, the grant can be added and the enrichment call wired in then.

